  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome and thanks for coming!\nThis is Restaurant Le Yeah, yeah?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C0063006F006D006500200061006E00640020007400680061006E006B007300200066006F007200200063006F006D0069006E00670021000A0054006800690073002000690073002000520065007300740061007500720061006E00740020004C006500200059006500610068002C00200079006500610068003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Would you like to take\non our full course? <U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006C0069006B006500200074006F002000740061006B0065000A006F006E0020006F00750072002000660075006C006C00200063006F0075007200730065003F002000100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Order as much as you\nlike, Sis. I’m buying!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00720064006500720020006100730020006D00750063006800200061007300200079006F0075000A006C0069006B0065002C0020005300690073002E002000492019006D00200062007500790069006E006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What I’d really like to order is\nthe Pokémon battle du jour!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200049201900640020007200650061006C006C00790020006C0069006B006500200074006F0020006F0072006400650072002000690073000A00740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C00650020006400750020006A006F0075007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know, honey, but it might\nput people off their meals...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E006F0077002C00200068006F006E00650079002C00200062007500740020006900740020006D0069006700680074000A007000750074002000700065006F0070006C00650020006F006600660020007400680065006900720020006D00650061006C0073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanna eat with\nmy Pokémon!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E006E0061002000650061007400200077006900740068000A006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They used to have a little spiel they’d give here.\nI think it went something like this.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Today’s fromage course features the ultimate in\nhard cheese, aged up to 180 years!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“We also have a blue cheese—simply biting into it\ngives off an odor so foul, your nose hairs burn.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“Finally, we have a washed-rind cheese made\nusing a female Arbok’s Toxic poison.”",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 362
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dessert is the same as always...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSorbet made from fresh Spelon and Rawst Berries\nwith tangy herbs in a whipped-mousse dressing.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d anticipated the quality, but I had no idea the\nquantity of food would also be so generous.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if we can’t manage it all, we’ll take the\nleftovers home for our dear Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Daddy... Are we rich now?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006400640079002E002E002E0020004100720065002000770065002000720069006300680020006E006F0077003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I can order anything at all?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell then, I’ll have the braciola of fresh Azure Bay\nSlowpoke tail.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s accompanied by Payapa Berry crudités glazed\nin an extra-virgin Oran oil, and has been described<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nas the gastronomical equivalent of a Gastly<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nglaring at a Hex Maniac, don’t you know.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 298
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dad’s being way too spend-happy. Did he win big\nin the Z-A Royale or something?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No need to hold back, gang!\nOrder whatever you like!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006E00650065006400200074006F00200068006F006C00640020006200610063006B002C002000670061006E00670021000A004F007200640065007200200077006800610074006500760065007200200079006F00750020006C0069006B006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A good Pokémon battle makes\nthe food taste better, too.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200067006F006F006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C00650020006D0061006B00650073000A00740068006500200066006F006F00640020007400610073007400650020006200650074007400650072002C00200074006F006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon battling with all they\nhave—now that’s the best spice!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C0069006E00670020007700690074006800200061006C006C00200074006800650079000A00680061007600652014006E006F0077002000740068006100742019007300200074006800650020006200650073007400200073007000690063006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re not grandmama and grandson today, no—\nwe’re just two adults out enjoying a lovely meal!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, don’t worry about me being lonely, dear.\nI enjoy my alone time quite a bit too!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I stay hidden, maybe the customers will stop\ncalling me over...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900660020004900200073007400610079002000680069006400640065006E002C0020006D0061007900620065002000740068006500200063007500730074006F006D006500720073002000770069006C006C002000730074006F0070000A00630061006C006C0069006E00670020006D00650020006F007600650072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You really like to slow down and\nenjoy your meals, don’t you?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650061006C006C00790020006C0069006B006500200074006F00200073006C006F007700200064006F0077006E00200061006E0064000A0065006E006A006F007900200079006F007500720020006D00650061006C0073002C00200064006F006E2019007400200079006F0075003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eating slowly is key to getting your\nstomach feeling nice and full.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006100740069006E006700200073006C006F0077006C00790020006900730020006B0065007900200074006F002000670065007400740069006E006700200079006F00750072000A00730074006F006D0061006300680020006600650065006C0069006E00670020006E00690063006500200061006E0064002000660075006C006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Swirlix is cuter by far!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200053007700690072006C00690078002000690073002000630075007400650072002000620079002000660061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, my Aromatisse is much\nmore charming, I assure you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C0020006D0079002000410072006F006D0061007400690073007300650020006900730020006D007500630068000A006D006F0072006500200063006800610072006D0069006E0067002C00200049002000610073007300750072006500200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The meat options here are\noutstanding as always.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020006D0065006100740020006F007000740069006F006E0073002000680065007200650020006100720065000A006F00750074007300740061006E00640069006E006700200061007300200061006C0077006100790073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chef Albern’s outdone\nhimself yet again.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680065006600200041006C006200650072006E201900730020006F007500740064006F006E0065000A00680069006D00730065006C0066002000790065007400200061006700610069006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I splurged quite a bit on this\nmeal, but I earned it today!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000730070006C007500720067006500640020007100750069007400650020006100200062006900740020006F006E00200074006800690073000A006D00650061006C002C0020006200750074002000490020006500610072006E0065006400200069007400200074006F00640061007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s our job as waiters to make sure\nour customers love coming back.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020006F007500720020006A006F00620020006100730020007700610069007400650072007300200074006F0020006D0061006B006500200073007500720065000A006F0075007200200063007500730074006F006D0065007200730020006C006F0076006500200063006F006D0069006E00670020006200610063006B002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
